  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To help deliver a more climate resilient, less carbon intensive and cleaner Bangladesh. The programme will help tackle adaptation, energy, environmental management and climate governance challenges at national and local level, in communities across Bangladesh.</narrative>
